#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Manage compute and data across your Qiskit pattern with Qiskit Serverless."
msgstr ""
"Urus pengkomputeran dan data merentas corak Qiskit anda dengan Qiskit "
"Serverless."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: sidebar_label
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage Qiskit Serverless compute and data resources"
msgstr "Urus sumber pengkomputeran dan data Qiskit Serverless"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"guides/serverless-manage-resources.ipynb\" "
"/>\n"
msgstr ""
"<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"guides/serverless-manage-resources.ipynb\" "
"/>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Package versions\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Versi pakej\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The code on this page was developed using the following requirements.\n"
"We recommend using these versions or newer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kod pada halaman ini dibangunkan menggunakan keperluan berikut.\n"
"Kami mengesyorkan penggunaan versi ini atau yang lebih baharu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"**Qiskit Serverless is getting an upgrade, and its features are changing fast.** During this development phase, find release notes and the most recent documentation at the [Qiskit Serverless GitHub](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/index.html) page.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"**Qiskit Serverless sedang menerima naik taraf, dan ciri-cirinya berubah dengan pantas.** Sepanjang fasa pembangunan ini, dapatkan nota keluaran dan dokumentasi terkini di halaman [Qiskit Serverless GitHub](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/index.html).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"With Qiskit Serverless, you can manage compute and data across your [Qiskit "
"pattern](/guides/intro-to-patterns), including CPUs, QPUs, and other compute"
" accelerators.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dengan Qiskit Serverless, anda boleh mengurus pengkomputeran dan data "
"merentas [corak Qiskit](/guides/intro-to-patterns) anda, termasuk CPU, QPU, "
"dan pempesat pengkomputeran lain.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Set detailed statuses {#set-detailed-statuses}"
msgstr "Tetapkan status terperinci {#set-detailed-statuses}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Serverless workloads have several stages across a workflow. By default, the "
"following statuses are viewable with `job.status()`:\n"
msgstr ""
"Beban kerja Serverless mempunyai beberapa peringkat merentasi aliran kerja. "
"Secara lalai, status berikut boleh dilihat dengan `job.status()`:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**`QUEUED`**: the workload is queued for classical resources\n"
msgstr "**`QUEUED`**: beban kerja sedang dalam barisan untuk sumber klasik\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**`INITIALIZING`**: the workload is set up\n"
msgstr "**`INITIALIZING`**: beban kerja sedang disediakan\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`RUNNING`**: the workload is currently running on classical resources\n"
msgstr "**`RUNNING`**: beban kerja sedang berjalan pada sumber klasik\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**`DONE`**: the workload has successfully completed\n"
msgstr "**`DONE`**: beban kerja telah selesai dengan jayanya\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can also set custom statuses that further describe the specific workflow"
" stage, as follows.\n"
msgstr ""
"Anda juga boleh menetapkan status tersuai yang menerangkan peringkat aliran "
"kerja tertentu dengan lebih lanjut, seperti berikut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"If you're reading the code cells locally in a notebook, you will see the `%%writefile` [magic command](https://ipython.readthedocs.io/en/stable/interactive/magics.html#cellmagic-writefile). Executing cells with this magic command saves them to disk rather than executing them.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"Jika anda membaca sel kod ini secara tempatan dalam notebook, anda akan melihat [arahan magik](https://ipython.readthedocs.io/en/stable/interactive/magics.html#cellmagic-writefile) `%%writefile`. Melaksanakan sel dengan arahan magik ini akan menyimpannya ke cakera dan bukannya melaksanakannya.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After successful completion of this workload (with `save_result()`), this "
"status will be updated to `DONE` automatically.\n"
msgstr ""
"Selepas beban kerja ini selesai dengan jayanya (dengan `save_result()`), "
"status ini akan dikemaskini secara automatik ke `DONE`.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Parallel workflows {#parallel-workflows}"
msgstr "Aliran kerja selari {#parallel-workflows}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For classical tasks that can be parallelized, use the `@distribute_task` "
"decorator to define compute requirements needed to perform a task. Start by "
"recalling the `transpile_remote.py` example from the [Write your first "
"Qiskit Serverless program](/guides/serverless-first-program) topic with the "
"following code.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk tugas klasik yang boleh diselarikan, gunakan penghias "
"`@distribute_task` untuk menentukan keperluan pengkomputeran yang diperlukan"
" bagi melaksanakan tugas. Mulakan dengan mengingat semula contoh "
"`transpile_remote.py` daripada topik [Tulis program Qiskit Serverless "
"pertama anda](/guides/serverless-first-program) dengan kod berikut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following code requires that you have already [saved your "
"credentials](/guides/cloud-setup).\n"
msgstr ""
"Kod berikut memerlukan anda telah [menyimpan kelayakan anda](/guides/cloud-"
"setup).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this example, you decorated the `transpile_remote()` function with "
"`@distribute_task(target={\"cpu\": 1})`. When run, this creates an "
"asynchronous parallel worker task with a single CPU core, and returns with a"
" reference to track the worker. To fetch the result, pass the reference to "
"the `get()` function. We can use this to run multiple parallel tasks:\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam contoh ini, anda telah menghias fungsi `transpile_remote()` dengan "
"`@distribute_task(target={\"cpu\": 1})`. Apabila dijalankan, ini mencipta "
"tugas pekerja selari tak segerak dengan satu teras CPU, dan memulangkan "
"rujukan untuk menjejak pekerja. Untuk mendapatkan keputusan, hantar rujukan "
"ke fungsi `get()`. Kita boleh menggunakannya untuk menjalankan beberapa "
"tugas selari:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Explore different task configurations {#explore-different-task-"
"configurations}"
msgstr ""
"Terokai konfigurasi tugas yang berbeza {#explore-different-task-"
"configurations}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can flexibly allocate CPU, GPU, and memory for your tasks via "
"`@distribute_task()`. For Qiskit Serverless on IBM Quantum&reg; Platform, "
"each program is equipped with 16 CPU cores and 32 GB RAM, which can be "
"allocated dynamically as needed.\n"
msgstr ""
"Anda boleh memperuntukkan CPU, GPU, dan memori secara fleksibel untuk tugas "
"anda melalui `@distribute_task()`. Untuk Qiskit Serverless di IBM "
"Quantum&reg; Platform, setiap program dilengkapi dengan 16 teras CPU dan 32 "
"GB RAM, yang boleh diperuntukkan secara dinamik mengikut keperluan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"CPU cores can be allocated as full CPU cores, or even fractional "
"allocations, as shown in the following.\n"
msgstr ""
"Teras CPU boleh diperuntukkan sebagai teras CPU penuh, atau bahkan "
"peruntukan pecahan, seperti yang ditunjukkan berikut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Memory is allocated in number of bytes. Recall that there are 1024 bytes in "
"a kilobyte, 1024 kilobytes in a megabyte, and 1024 megabytes in a gigabyte. "
"To allocate 2 GB of memory for your worker, you need to allocate `\"mem\": 2"
" * 1024 * 1024 * 1024`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Memori diperuntukkan dalam bilangan bait. Ingat bahawa terdapat 1024 bait "
"dalam satu kilobait, 1024 kilobait dalam satu megabait, dan 1024 megabait "
"dalam satu gigabait. Untuk memperuntukkan memori sebanyak 2 GB bagi pekerja "
"anda, anda perlu memperuntukkan `\"mem\": 2 * 1024 * 1024 * 1024`.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Manage data across your program {#manage-data-across-your-program}"
msgstr "Urus data merentas program anda {#manage-data-across-your-program}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit Serverless allows you to manage files in the `/data` directory across"
" all your programs. This includes several limitations:\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit Serverless membolehkan anda mengurus fail dalam direktori `/data` "
"merentas semua program anda. Ini termasuk beberapa had:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Only `tar` and `h5` files are supported today\n"
msgstr "Hanya fail `tar` dan `h5` yang disokong pada masa ini\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This is only a flat `/data` storage, and cannot have `/data/folder/` "
"subdirectories\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini hanya storan `/data` rata, dan tidak boleh mempunyai subdirektori "
"`/data/folder/`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following shows how to upload files. Be sure you have authenticated to "
"Qiskit Serverless with your IBM Quantum account (see [Upload to Qiskit "
"Serverless](/guides/serverless-first-program#upload-to-qiskit-serverless) "
"for instructions).\n"
msgstr ""
"Berikut menunjukkan cara memuat naik fail. Pastikan anda telah mengesahkan "
"ke Qiskit Serverless dengan akaun IBM Quantum anda (lihat [Muat naik ke "
"Qiskit Serverless](/guides/serverless-first-program#upload-to-qiskit-"
"serverless) untuk arahan).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, you can list all the files in your `data` directory. This data is "
"accessible to all programs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Seterusnya, anda boleh menyenaraikan semua fail dalam direktori `data` anda."
" Data ini boleh diakses oleh semua program.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This can be done from a program by using `file_download()` to download the "
"file to the program environment, and uncompressing the `tar`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini boleh dilakukan daripada program dengan menggunakan `file_download()` "
"untuk memuat turun fail ke persekitaran program, dan menyahzipkan `tar`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"At this point, your program can interact with the files, as you would a "
"local experiment. `file_upload()` , `file_download()`, and `file_delete()` "
"can be called from your local experiment, or your uploaded program, for "
"consistent and flexible data management.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pada ketika ini, program anda boleh berinteraksi dengan fail, sama seperti "
"eksperimen tempatan. `file_upload()`, `file_download()`, dan `file_delete()`"
" boleh dipanggil dari eksperimen tempatan anda, atau program yang dimuat "
"naik anda, untuk pengurusan data yang konsisten dan fleksibel.\n"

